{"suttaId":"thag6.13","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1960,1978],"vripara":"447"},"segments":{"thag6.13:0.4":"Sirimaṇḍattheragāthā","thag6.13:1.1":"[udā.45; cūḷava.385; pari.339]“Channamativassati, vivaṭaṃ nātivassati;","thag6.13:1.3":"Tasmā channaṃ vivaretha, evaṃ taṃ nātivassati.","thag6.13:2.1":"[saṃ. ni.1.66; netti.18]“Maccunābbhahato loko, jarāya parivārito;","thag6.13:2.3":"Taṇhāsallena otiṇṇo, icchādhūpāyito sadā.","thag6.13:3.1":"“Maccunābbhahato loko, parikkhitto jarāya ca;","thag6.13:3.3":"Haññati niccamattāṇo, pattadaṇḍova takkaro.","thag6.13:4.1":"“Āgacchantaggikhandhāva, maccu byādhi jarā tayo;","thag6.13:4.3":"Paccuggantuṃ balaṃ natthi, javo natthi palāyituṃ.","thag6.13:5.1":"“Amoghaṃ divasaṃ kayirā, appena bahukena vā;","thag6.13:5.3":"Yaṃ yaṃ vijahate [virahate (sī. pī.), vivahate (syā.)] rattiṃ, tadūnaṃ tassa jīvitaṃ.","thag6.13:6.1":"“Carato tiṭṭhato vāpi, āsīnasayanassa vā;","thag6.13:6.3":"Upeti carimā ratti, na te kālo pamajjitun”ti.","thag6.13:6.5":"… Sirimaṇḍo [sirimando (sī.)] thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
